invariant: INV-67
file: mldsa_vector.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-vector
reason: the lanes' reduction adds no rounding bit, so it rounds down
  where mld_reduce32 rounds to the nearest multiple of 2^23. Every value
  stays congruent mod q, so a signature still verifies, but a
  coefficient whose bit 22 is set leaves the reduction q above the loops'
  value. bin/mldsa_vector_equiv_test compares coefficients exactly, and
  the script runs it for arm64 under qemu-aarch64.

--- old
    lanes t = vaddq_s32(vshrq_n_s32(a, 23), vreinterpretq_s32_u32(bit22));
--- new
    lanes t = vaddq_s32(vshrq_n_s32(a, 23), vreinterpretq_s32_u32(vbicq_u32(bit22, bit22)));
